{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> PLAYNESE: Master Japanese</strong> is a  JRPG where you <i>learn Japanese by playing</i>.\u00a0It aims to teach the entire Japanese language from absolute beginner to mastery, all within a school setting, and natural, open-world gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fantasy world, battle with Japanese cards, and study at your own pace, from absolute beginner, Hiragana to JLPT N1 preparation. Choose your level and start learning Japanese while having fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Some Key Features Include</strong></u><strong>:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCover <strong>2,500 kanji</strong> with mnemonics, writing practice, and readings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb<strong>Hiragana &amp; Katakana</strong> with mnemonics, writing, and pronunciation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAn <strong>in-game school</strong> with classrooms where you can read, listen to music, study kanji and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb<strong>Rooms full of books</strong>, from beginner to advanced, that you can read with narration and quizzes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb<strong>JLPT</strong>\u00a0<strong>Language test practice</strong> with quizzes and explanations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb<strong>Two Modes</strong>: Full Japanese or Study Mode (furigana + English)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb<strong>Fully voiced</strong> NPC dialogues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<u><strong>The Study-Play Game Loop</strong></u><strong>:\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\ufe0f\u20e3 Learn Japanese to earn money. [All Levels Welcome]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\ufe0f\u20e3<strong>\u00a0</strong>Buy cards and items, battle creatures, NPCs and Gym Leaders, and earn badges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\ufe0f\u20e3 \ud83d\udd28Craft, \ud83d\udcb1Trade, \ud83c\udfa3Fish and \ud83c\udf3eHarvest resources.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u30fb<strong>PLAYNESE</strong> is a deeply in-depth adventure where you\u2019ll have to explore, experiment, and uncover secrets in a constantly growing Open World \ud83c\udf0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Absorb Japanese naturally while having fun</u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbTrack your Japanese progress and earn Japanese yen (\u5186) as you go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/289c7768c74653aa5395ffa13de57cc0.avif?t=1774296180\" width=576 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb<u>EARLY ACCESS</u>: Constant Updates filled with <u>Language and Adventure</u> :)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u307e\u305f\u306d\uff01\uff3c\uff08\uff3e\u25cb\uff3e\uff09\u4eba\uff08\uff3e\u25cb\uff3e\uff09\uff0f</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764890?t=1774296180","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764890?t=1774296180","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/816c98e0cb7536bc1fe08dd32dc449f94781fd29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774296180","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/816c98e0cb7536bc1fe08dd32dc449f94781fd29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774296180","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> PLAYNESE: Master Japanese</strong> is a  JRPG where you <i>learn Japanese by playing</i>.\u00a0It aims to teach the entire Japanese language from absolute beginner to mastery, all within a school setting, and natural, open-world gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fantasy world, battle with Japanese cards, and study at your own pace, from absolute beginner, Hiragana to JLPT N1 preparation. Choose your level and start learning Japanese while having fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Some Key Features Include</strong></u><strong>:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCover <strong>2,500 kanji</strong> with mnemonics, writing practice, and readings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb<strong>Hiragana &amp; Katakana</strong> with mnemonics, writing, and pronunciation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAn <strong>in-game school</strong> with classrooms where you can read, listen to music, study kanji and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb<strong>Rooms full of books</strong>, from beginner to advanced, that you can read with narration and quizzes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb<strong>JLPT</strong>\u00a0<strong>Language test practice</strong> with quizzes and explanations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb<strong>Two Modes</strong>: Full Japanese or Study Mode (furigana + English)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb<strong>Fully voiced</strong> NPC dialogues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<u><strong>The Study-Play Game Loop</strong></u><strong>:\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\ufe0f\u20e3 Learn Japanese to earn money. [All Levels Welcome]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\ufe0f\u20e3<strong>\u00a0</strong>Buy cards and items, battle creatures, NPCs and Gym Leaders, and earn badges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\ufe0f\u20e3 \ud83d\udd28Craft, \ud83d\udcb1Trade, \ud83c\udfa3Fish and \ud83c\udf3eHarvest resources.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u30fb<strong>PLAYNESE</strong> is a deeply in-depth adventure where you\u2019ll have to explore, experiment, and uncover secrets in a constantly growing Open World \ud83c\udf0